  "description": "Battery days left on the glance sleep face (ha-paper#30, emulator src/core/batteryDays.ts, firmware core/battery_days.cpp). model: % a day = 24 h × (awake share × 40 mA + asleep share × 0.2 mA) / 1100 mAh × 100; awake share from the wake tally (awakeMs, asleepS) once it covers 6 h, else 11 min a day. anchor: the first filtered gauge % seen unplugged with a sane clock; charging clears it, a rise or a clock going back restarts it, pct < 0 keeps it. estimate: after 1 h, measured = max(drop, 0.5) / days since the anchor, weight = min(1, max(drop / 10, days / 7)); rate = weight × measured + (1 − weight) × model; days = floor(pct / rate + 0.5) clamped to 1…100 (100 = \"99+\"). days null = charging or gauge unknown. en / nl: the face line (\"\" = none); json: GET /diagnostics battery.estimate (rates rounded to 3 decimals).",
